The Orchestrator YAML DSL is a custom workflow language owned and maintained by
Reimaginate. It is inspired by concepts and terminology from the CNCF Serverless
Workflow DSL specification:

https://github.com/serverlessworkflow/specification

The Serverless Workflow specification is made available under the Apache License
